{"step_index":329,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T10:20:16Z","content":"I have added the requested **Login Page** and updated the **Stakeholder Requirements**:\n\n### 1. 🔑 Login Page & Authentication Added\n* **Login Route & Component** ([`frontend/src/pages/Login.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/frontend/src/pages/Login.tsx)): Added a glassmorphic login interface with JWT authentication, error messages, and **4 role preset quick-login helper cards**:\n  * **Developer**: `developer` / `DevPass123!`\n  * **Security Administrator**: `sec_admin` / `SecAdminPass123!`\n  * **Project Administrator**: `proj_admin` / `ProjAdminPass123!`\n  * **System Administrator**: `sys_admin` / `SysAdminPass123!`\n* **Auth Context** ([`frontend/src/context/AuthContext.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/frontend/src/context/AuthContext.tsx)): Manages JWT bearer tokens and active user profile state.\n* **Sidebar Integration** ([`frontend/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/frontend/src/components/Sidebar.tsx)): Displays active user profile badge and a **Sign Out** button.\n\n---\n\n### 2. 👥 Updated Stakeholder & User Types Matrix\n\nThe documentation and SRS table deliverable ([`phase2_srs_requirements_table.md`](file:///c:/Users/addal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2ac62f09-2e24-4efd-bd40-62368c77dbf2/phase2_srs_requirements_table.md)) have been updated with the exact four requested roles:\n\n| Stakeholder / User Type | Role and Responsibilities |\n|---|---|\n| **Developer** | Registers projects, manages dependencies, initiates scans, views vulnerabilities and tracks remediation. The primary user. |\n| **Security Administrator** | Monitors findings, reviews risk reports, manages security policies and verifies remediation. |\n| **Project Administrator** | Manages projects, project metadata, dependencies and build artifacts. |\n| **System Administrator** | Maintains the platform, database, backend services and access permissions. |"}
