{"step_index":375,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T10:32:33Z","content":"**Yes!** Both hardened Docker image definitions and orchestration configurations have been created for your codebase:\n\n---\n\n### 📦 1. Created Dockerfiles & Configurations\n\n* **Backend Multi-Stage Hardened Dockerfile**: [`backend/Dockerfile`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/backend/Dockerfile)\n  * Multi-stage build (`python:3.11-slim`).\n  * Runs under an unprivileged non-root user (`appuser`, UID `10001`).\n  * Exposes strictly port `8001`.\n* **Frontend Multi-Stage Hardened Dockerfile**: [`frontend/Dockerfile`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/frontend/Dockerfile)\n  * Multi-stage build (`node:20-alpine`).\n  * Runs under non-root `appuser` (UID `10002`) with production build artifacts served via `serve`.\n* **Orchestration Manifest**: [`docker-compose.yml`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/docker-compose.yml)\n\n---\n\n### 🛡️ Applied Container Security Controls\n\n1. **Minimal Base Images**: Uses lightweight `-slim` and `-alpine` base images, stripping unnecessary compilers, debug tools, and distribution bloat to minimize attack surface.\n2. **Non-Root Execution**: Container processes run under non-root service accounts (`appuser`), preventing container escape privilege escalations.\n3. **Layer Cache Optimization**: Decouples dependency installation steps from source code changes to speed up builds.\n4. **Decoupled Secret Handling**: Excludes keys and passwords from image layers via environment variable injection and `.dockerignore`.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to Build & Run the Images on Your Laptop\n\nOnce you start **Docker Desktop** on Windows, execute these commands in PowerShell:\n\n#### Build & Start both containers using Compose:\n```powershell\ncd c:\\Users\\addal\\Documents\\antigravity\\focused-bell\n\ndocker-compose up --build\n```\n\n#### Or Build individual Docker images:\n```powershell\n# Build Backend Container Image\ndocker build -t securechain-backend:v1.0.0 ./backend\n\n# Build Frontend Container Image\ndocker build -t securechain-frontend:v1.0.0 ./frontend\n```"}
